<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26242" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lentĭcŭla</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		dim.
		2. lens, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a lentil.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">faba vel lenticula,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					2, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hoc mense lenticulam seres,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 3, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The shape of a lentil, lentilshape</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37,
				12, 75, § 196</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A vessel shaped like a lentil</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vasa fictilia (quas a similitudine lenticulas
					vocant),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 2, 17, § 25</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Isid. Orig. 20, 7, 4</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Vulg. 1
				Reg. 10, 1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>A freckly eruption, freckles</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 26, 1,
				5, § 7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lenticulam tollunt galbanum et nitrum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels. 6,
					5</span></i>
			; cf. lentigo.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
